  "title": "Q3 2024 Expenses | 2024年第三季度消费总结",
  "summary": "用三星拍的iPhone广告牌 @ Chinatown coverpeople 九月 进入第四季度生活工作大爆炸，幸好现在是季更晚了一个月也不会觉得太糟糕，嘿嘿。在下班前半小时把表格格式统一好了，回家路上打开keep note就开始倒脑内碎碎念。 第三季度迎来我们搬来后的第一次续租，房租涨了$46，在纽约可能是run don't walk的涨价幅度。这季度平均电费比第一季度高了快200刀，但今年吃冰淇淋的次数好像一只手都能数得过来，要感谢costco白桃给的满足感。这个夏天终于学会自制日本餐馆里清爽 carrot ginger dressing ，这是trader joes停产后就一直想念的沙拉酱，自己量产后吃了很多很多沙拉。 七月底Chikalicious店主退休 前和象友幸运地walk in吃到了当时菜单上…",
  "content": "<figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/ea178a0d-6c78-4aea-a1d3-ead20683ede0/20240718_203004.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"3890\" height=\"2917\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          <p>用三星拍的iPhone广告牌 @ Chinatown</p>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n  \n    \n      \n    \n      \n        \n          \n            <span>coverpeople</span>\n          \n          <span>九月</span>\n        \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n      \n    \n      \n    \n      \n    \n      \n    \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>进入第四季度生活工作大爆炸，幸好现在是季更晚了一个月也不会觉得太糟糕，嘿嘿。在下班前半小时把表格格式统一好了，回家路上打开keep note就开始倒脑内碎碎念。</p><p>第三季度迎来我们搬来后的第一次续租，房租涨了$46，在纽约可能是run don&#x27;t walk的涨价幅度。这季度平均电费比第一季度高了快200刀，但今年吃冰淇淋的次数好像一只手都能数得过来，要感谢costco白桃给的满足感。这个夏天终于学会自制日本餐馆里清爽 <a href=\"https://www.justonecookbook.com/carrot-ginger-dressing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>carrot ginger dressing</span></a>，这是trader joes停产后就一直想念的沙拉酱，自己量产后吃了很多很多沙拉。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/FoodNYC/comments/1eljoy6/grubstreet_the_end_of_chikalicious/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">七月底Chikalicious店主退休</a>前和象友幸运地walk in吃到了当时菜单上的所有甜品，是让我久违地体会到甜品带来幸福感的一家店，Chika非常擅长把食材本身的味道在第一道清口sorbet中提炼出来，记忆里有吃到过青苹果、桃子、茉莉花、姜味……香气十足又不会太甜，简直是正中我心的演绎。搭配的盘子也是复古日式小碎花，摆盘适当留白，视觉味觉双重享受。我喜欢坐在吧台上，可以看到Chika行云流水的操作，羡慕的同时也很能体会这种长期站立的辛苦，<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IbqskAKFgzw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">后来再读她的故事才得知她居然是华尔街banker半路出家</a>，选择在911之后的节点开一家概念如此独特的餐厅，更加仰慕了。现在城里类似的体验可能只剩下一些价格不菲的fine dining （最近发现restaurant yuu的pastry chef偶尔会有dessert pop-up，但$100的价格让chika的$26三道course更显良心）</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/41ae3a75-2cf0-4cde-89d3-c711f3bf82ee/chi.PNG?format=1000w\" width=\"626\" height=\"128\">\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p>（过去一年去了四次，还是去少了 TAT）</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652350046-3OC28Q212HZVCQUCH4Z0/20230916_171016.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"20230916_171016.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652350046-3OC28Q212HZVCQUCH4Z0/20230916_171016.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652350636-W70TDVEOW0M4IAB58EZ6/20231117_153058.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"20231117_153058.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652350636-W70TDVEOW0M4IAB58EZ6/20231117_153058.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652354037-OQ4PGC6YZZ4OMVQUZCVR/20231208_211040.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"20231208_211040.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652354037-OQ4PGC6YZZ4OMVQUZCVR/20231208_211040.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652353939-587GQOAIN14DWDRZP5ZO/20240725_183722.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"20240725_183722.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729652353939-587GQOAIN14DWDRZP5ZO/20240725_183722.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>九月初和家属自驾去蒙特利尔、魁北克，在蒙特利尔见到了一年一会的朋友聊得好开心，<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C_5kVLruvOl/?img_index=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>在魁北克约摄影师拍了一组照片纪念也很满意</span></a>（每几年找专业人士记录一下俩人当下的样子还是挺珍贵的，毕竟每一年都是未来最瘦的自己，哈哈），还顺道买了去年rent the runway租到很喜欢的<a href=\"https://shopstyle.it/l/chriq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>mackage羽绒服*</span></a>。即便没赶上深秋枫景（九月底正是农忙时期牛马请不出假），好歹了却了想去魁北克的心愿（其实我分三次才看完《鬼怪》，纯粹是被里面的美景吸引）。<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/1mXE3GfFXLWTjVSUEBIcZ0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">去魁省的见闻在这个月的播客里详细聊了聊，大家感兴趣可以听~</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              <img alt=\"xiuyuan &amp; dan (3).jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690775582-4L9BM9R1A9J4EYNF90LZ/xiuyuan+%26+dan+%283%29.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n            \n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              <img alt=\"17..jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690772166-ALKT5SQ6268RBPOKU00P/17..jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n            \n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              <img alt=\"IMG_6949.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690774807-F91UERMB3AGIDJRLL83J/IMG_6949.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n            \n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              <img alt=\"xa-quebecphotoshoot-85.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690877250-55QJOB1OHOY1TM3N48OK/xa-quebecphotoshoot-85.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n            \n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n      \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p>九月底的大事是领养了两只一岁的小貂，也是今年的家庭的头等大事。缘起是因为Mui比Lily大一岁，经历过之前雪貂的过世后我们担心万一未来Lily落单会很抑郁；再加上我俩每天都要出门上班，两只貂似乎只有在我们在家时更活跃，但有四只貂貂随时可以high起来。我们在纽约州的雪貂Facebook Group里提交领养申请后一直没有遇上合适年龄的貂貂，甚至都开始打算要不要开车去芝加哥shelter。直到看到长岛这一对刚好快要一岁的Phoebe和Penelope（pepe）。我一直想再接一只OJ花色的雪貂回家，Phoebe刚巧是。接回家后发现她连性格都很像OJ，胆小又温柔，舔舐的时候舌头跟沙纸一般粗糙 XD 而pepe虽然现在还是会咬我们来得到注意力，但是性格极其活泼，跟Energeizer劲量电池的小兔子一样充满能量，时不时碰瓷其他三只一起玩。因为之前OJ不太能被Fin和Fergie接受的前车之鉴，当时特意带上了Mui和Lily先看看它们的相处情况，近一个月下来四只雪貂相处得出乎意料地好（这里得“得”和“地”用对了吗），家属和我都时不时感叹走了大运。</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691408003-YMXG26300O7Z03ZQ9X4E/20240927_205701.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"Phoebe\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691408003-YMXG26300O7Z03ZQ9X4E/20240927_205701.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n                  Phoebe\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691408069-09NXV8TB9E86ZK1HIB39/20241003_073742.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"officially &quot;business&quot; owner\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691408069-09NXV8TB9E86ZK1HIB39/20241003_073742.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n                  officially &quot;business&quot; owner\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691466568-9QR5O2FAY8PGNO6U1SCS/Screenshot_20241023_094707_Gallery.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"Penelope (aka pepe)\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729691466568-9QR5O2FAY8PGNO6U1SCS/Screenshot_20241023_094707_Gallery.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n                  Penelope (aka pepe)\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>家属year 2上班时间不再那么恐怖，随着俩人周末宅家时间多了，就想着捯饬一下家里，所以这个季度给洗手间换了更好用的水龙头（谁家好人租房还亲自换水龙头），也买了不少家居物件，觊觎了很久的<a href=\"https://6ixthsensela.com/products/tradition-setago-jh27-portable-lamp?_pos=1&amp;_sid=b0a2b2b65&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>&amp;tradition setago无线灯</span></a>（这家LA家居店网站时不时有75折）、<a href=\"https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/noedmast-led-portable-lamp-battery-operated-light-pink-dark-gray-green-40578457/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>点亮餐桌的IKEA NÖDMAST无线灯</span></a>、让家里地上裤子都消失的<a href=\"https://amzn.to/4eSTUM3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>移动裤架*</span></a>。公寓入门处的鞋子收纳一直没找到合适的鞋柜，后来在宜家看到很丑却实用的<a href=\"https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/pinnig-coat-rack-with-shoe-storage-bench-black-20329789/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PINNIG hall tree</a>就买了，的确也解决了我们日常八双鞋子和出门遛貂外套的收纳难题。住了一年发现虽然Facebook Marketplace很容易遇到好东西，但是依赖公共交通想把它们搬回家实在太难，大多数时候为了省时省力不开车进城只好买新的了。</p><p>无聊的花销：这个季度开了Roth IRA，税前税后投资我都没有放进YNAB，只留在Empower Personal Capital里偶尔看看。七月搞定了家属明年去中国的签证（甚至连回国机票都买好了！），九月底二转十也提交了申请，算是完成了今年两件adulting大事。今年开始用YNAB后博客续费也早就每月安排好存钱目标所以不会觉得很肉疼，刚巧还有一个豆瓣友邻搜到我的<a href=\"https://www.after27.me/blog/venture-x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">capital one venture x分享</a>用了我的链接四舍五入今年博客续费没花钱 girl math (〃∀〃)</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690955134-K0L7RHKO0TG53TKQONU0/Q3%2BGUGUFAM.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"GUGUFAM Q3\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690955134-K0L7RHKO0TG53TKQONU0/Q3%2BGUGUFAM.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n                  GUGUFAM Q3\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690974982-18Y7B539HU5UZNHNFR9G/Q3%2Bgugumom.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"gugumom Q3\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5d24f88b8ff0730001a3dfb7/1729690974982-18Y7B539HU5UZNHNFR9G/Q3%2Bgugumom.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n                  gugumom Q3",
